                <mxCell id="pnote" value="Hard rule: no tool in this set can mutate any live system. The agent has no write scope in Entra beyond its own Cosmos container and its Service Bus topic." style="rounded=1;fillColor=#F8CECC;strokeColor=#B85450;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
